ze the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: to gather, collect or obtain.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: People often collect items.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: People often gather things.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: to gather.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: to obtain or gather.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Ladies and gentlemen, esteemed colleagues, and honored guests, I stand before you today to address a matter of great importance and gravity. It is with a sense of duty and responsibility that I must express my deep disappointment and concern regarding the recent events that have transpired.\n\nAs we gather here today, I am reminded of the high standards and expectations that we have set for ourselves as a collective entity. We have worked tirelessly to build a reputation of excellence, of integrity, and of commitment to our values. However, I am afraid that recent actions have fallen woefully short of these ideals.\n\nThe behavior exhibited by certain individuals has been, to put it mildly, unacceptable. The lack of respect, the disregard for protocol, and the blatant disregard for the well-being of others have created a toxic environment that is detrimental to our very fabric. It is our collective responsibility to ensure that we maintain a workplace that is inclusive, respectful, and safe for all.\n\nLet me be clear: we will not tolerate behavior that undermines our core values. We will not condone actions that compromise the trust and confidence that our stakeholders have placed in us. We will not permit a culture of complacency and entitlement to take root.\n\nAs leaders, we must take ownership of our actions and our decisions. We must hold ourselves and others accountable for our behavior. We must be willing to confront the difficult conversations, to address the uncomfortable truths, and to make the necessary changes to ensure that we are living up to our full potential.\n\nI urge each and every one of you to reflect on your actions and to consider the impact that they have on others. Let us strive to be better, to do better, and to be better representatives of our organization. Let us work together to create a culture that is built on respect, empathy, and a commitment to excellence.\n\nIn conclusion, I want to emphasize that we will be taking immediate action to address these concerns. We will be implementing new policies and procedures to ensure that our workplace is a safe and inclusive environment for all. We will be providing training and support to help individuals understand and adhere to our values and expectations.\n\nI expect each and every one of you to take this matter seriously and to take ownership of your actions. Let us work together to build a workplace that we can be proud of, a workplace that reflects our values and our commitment to excellence.\n\nThank you.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Ladies and gentlemen, esteemed colleagues, and honored guests, I stand before you today to address a matter of great importance and gravity. It is with a sense of duty and responsibility that I must speak to you about the recent events that have transpired, and the actions that have been taken.\n\nAs we gather here today, I want to emphasize the significance of the occasion. We are not merely convening for the sake of convening, but rather to address a pressing issue that requires our collective attention and collective action. It is with this in mind that I must express my deep disappointment and concern regarding the recent developments.\n\nThe actions taken by some individuals have fallen woefully short of the standards that we hold dear. The lack of consideration, the disregard for the well-being of others, and the blatant disregard for the rules and regulations that govern our behavior have been nothing short of appalling.\n\nLet me be clear: we will not tolerate such behavior in our midst. We will not stand idly by while individuals disregard the principles that have guided us thus far. We will not permit the erosion of the trust and respect that have been built over time. We will not allow the actions of a few to undermine the progress and achievements that we have worked so hard to attain.\n\nAs we move forward, I want to emphasize the importance of accountability. We must hold ourselves and one another accountable for our actions. We must recognize that our individual actions have consequences, and that those consequences can have far-reaching impacts on ourselves, our colleagues, and our organization as a whole.\n\nTo those who have fallen short, I urge you to reflect on your actions and to take immediate corrective action. We expect a higher standard of behavior from ourselves and from one another. We expect respect, we expect consideration, and we expect a commitment to upholding the values that we hold dear.\n\nTo those who have demonstrated exemplary behavior, I want to express my sincerest appreciation and gratitude. Your actions have not gone unnoticed, and we are grateful for your commitment to upholding the standards that we have set.\n\nAs we move forward, I want to emphasize the importance of teamwork and collaboration. We must work together to address the challenges that lie before us. We must support one another, we must lift one another up, and we must strive to create an environment that is inclusive, respectful, and supportive.\n\nIn closing, I want to reiterate the gravity of the situation and the importance of our collective response. We must rise to the challenge, we must take responsibility for our actions, and we must work together to build a brighter future for ourselves and for our organization.\n\nThank you.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Administer a lengthy, formal lecture or rebuke.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: She launched into a lengthy and stern lecture.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: **Formal Address**\n\nLadies and gentlemen, esteemed colleagues, and honored guests, I stand before you today to address a matter of great importance and gravity. It is with a sense of responsibility and duty that I take up this task, and I implore you all to listen attentively to the words that I am about to convey.\n\nAs we gather in this hallowed institution, we are reminded of the high standards that we strive to uphold. We are a community built on the principles of excellence, integrity, and respect. And yet, I fear that we have fallen short of these ideals in recent times.\n\nThe behavior that has been exhibited by some of our members has been nothing short of unacceptable. It has been a source of great distress and disappointment, not only to those who have been directly affected but also to the wider community that we serve.\n\nLet me be clear: we will not tolerate any behavior that undermines the values that we hold dear. We will not stand idly by while individuals engage in actions that bring shame and discredit to our institution. We will not allow our reputation to be tarnished by the actions of a few.\n\nAs a community, we must hold ourselves to the highest standards of conduct. We must conduct ourselves with dignity, respect, and compassion. We must be mindful of the impact that our actions have on others and strive to create an environment that is inclusive, supportive, and welcoming to all.\n\nTo those who have engaged in behavior that has fallen short of our expectations, I urge you to reflect on your actions and consider the consequences of your behavior. I implore you to take responsibility for your actions and to make amends in any way that you can.\n\nTo the wider community, I ask that you hold us accountable for our actions. Demand that we live up to our ideals and that we strive to be a beacon of excellence and integrity. Encourage us to be better, to do better, and to be a source of inspiration to all who come into contact with us.\n\nIn closing, I want to remind you all that we are a community of leaders. We are a community of individuals who are committed to making a positive impact on the world. And it is our responsibility to ensure that our actions reflect the values that we hold dear.\n\nLet us strive to be better, to do better, and to be a source of pride for our institution. Let us show the world what it means to be a community of leaders who are guided by the principles of excellence, integrity, and respect.\n\nThank you.\n\n**Adjournment**\n\nThis formal address has been concluded. I now invite you to take a moment to reflect on the words that have been spoken and to consider the implications for our community.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Ladies and gentlemen, esteemed colleagues, and honored guests, I stand before you today to address a matter of utmost importance and gravity. It is with a sense of duty, responsibility, and a deep commitment to the values that underpin our organization that I must deliver this formal talk.\n\nAs we gather here today, I am compelled to speak to the recent events that have transpired, and the actions that have been taken by certain individuals within our community. It is essential that we confront these incidents head-on, with candor, and with a resolve to rectify the situation.\n\nWe are an organization built on the principles of integrity, respect, and accountability. We pride ourselves on being a beacon of excellence, a shining example of what can be achieved through dedication, hard work, and a shared commitment to our mission. However, it is our collective responsibility to acknowledge when we fall short of these ideals.\n\nThe recent incidents have not only tarnished our reputation but have also caused harm to our colleagues, our clients, and our community at large. It is imperative that we take a long, hard look at ourselves, and that we acknowledge the systemic issues that have contributed to these problems.\n\nWe must recognize that our actions have consequences, and that our inactions can have far-reaching and devastating effects. It is our duty to create an environment that is inclusive, safe, and respectful for all. Anything less is unacceptable.\n\nAs leaders, we must set the tone and establish the standards that guide our behavior. We must lead by example, and we must hold ourselves and others accountable for our actions. We must be willing to confront difficult conversations, to listen to diverse perspectives, and to take bold action to address the problems that we face.\n\nIn the coming days and weeks, we will be taking concrete steps to address the issues that have arisen. We will be implementing new policies, procedures, and training programs to ensure that our organization is better equipped to prevent similar incidents in the future. We will be providing support and resources to those who have been affected, and we will be working tirelessly to rebuild trust and confidence within our community.\n\nHowever, this is not just about fixing the problems that we face; it is about creating a better future for ourselves, for our colleagues, and for the communities that we serve. It is about recognizing that we are not just individuals, but that we are part of a larger whole, connected by a shared purpose and a commitment to excellence.\n\nIn closing, I want to emphasize that we are at a crossroads. We can choose to continue down the path of complacency, or we can choose to embark on a journey of transformation and growth. We can choose to prioritize our own interests, or we can choose to prioritize the greater good.\n\nI urge each and every one of you to join me on this journey. Let us work together to create an organization that is worthy of our highest aspirations. Let us strive to be a beacon of hope, a shining example of what can be achieved when we come together with a shared purpose and a commitment to excellence.\n\nThank you.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: administer a lengthy verbal rebuke.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Deliver a lengthy, formal lecture or rebuke.'}], [{'role': 'user', 