e the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: The sun was setting over the bustling streets of Tokyo, casting a warm orange glow over the crowded sidewalks. Amidst the sea of pedestrians, a young skateboarder stood out, his sleek black shirt and fitted jeans a testament to his urban style. His dark hair was slicked back, revealing a determined look on his face as he prepared to showcase his skills.\n\nWith a deep breath, he dropped into a crouch, his eyes fixed intently on the concrete below. The crowd parted as he rolled forward, his board gliding smoothly over the ground. He began to pick up speed, his muscles tensed and ready to spring into action.\n\nAs he approached the edge of a small ramp, he launched himself into the air, his board flying beneath him. Time seemed to slow as he soared above the ground, his arms outstretched and his face set in a fierce grin.\n\nThe crowd gasped in unison as he landed smoothly, his board rolling to a stop beneath him. He stood up, a triumphant smile spreading across his face as he basked in the applause of the onlookers. For a moment, he stood still, savoring the thrill of the trick and the adoration of the crowd.\n\nAnd then, with a nod to the cheering spectators, he dropped back into a crouch, ready to take on the next challenge that came his way.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: The Eiffel Tower was built in Paris.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: They described their needs in detail.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not ou