ummary.\nSentence: "Oh, words of beauty, spoken with melody,\nEchoing through hearts, in harmony.\nA language of rhythm, a symphony of soul,\nWith every phrase, a story unfold.\n\nRecite with passion, recite with fire,\nLet the words dance, like a heart\'s desire.\nWith musical intonation, let the voice soar,\nAnd the message of love, forever roar.\n\nIn chant or in psalm, let the words resound,\nA call to the heart, a message unbound.\nWith every note, a truth is revealed,\nAnd the beauty of language, forever concealed."'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Hear us, hear us, a tale to tell,\nOf steps that are simple, yet stories to compel,\nTwo steps begin, the journey to start,\nData reliability's path, within the heart.\n\nTwo simple steps, the foundation laid,\nThe process unfolds, as the journey's made,\nWith care and with thought, the path is defined,\nData reliability's truth, forever aligned.\n\nA woman walks, a bike by her side,\nA blue bike gliding, with gentle pride,\nAcross the road, with steady pace,\nA lady's calm, in a busy space.\n\nA brick building stands, a backdrop grand,\nAn older woman sits, with pencil in hand,\nDrawing with care, with lines so fine,\nA story unfolding, a moment divine.\n\nA power line's hum, a person's plight,\nHanging upside down, in the morning light,\nA precarious pose, a daring feat,\nA risk taken, with heart that beats.\n\nAn elderly male, with a gentle hold,\nA young child crying, with a story untold,\nComfort and care, in his loving arms,\nA moment of peace, that dispels all alarms."}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: Hear us now, in solemn tone,\nA young child cries, all alone,\nIn the grasp of an elderly hand,\